  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      65.25,
      328.09,
      522.43,
      375.76
    ],
    "text": "FILLING OF A VACANCY IN THE OFFICE OF CHAIRMAN OF THE NORWOOD PRADESHIYASABAH UNDER SECTION 66B(2) OF THE LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTIONS ORDINANCE(CHAPTER 262) AS AMENDED BY LOCAL AUTHORITIES ELECTION (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 16 OF 2017",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      388.69,
      488.79,
      399.76
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS the office of Chairman in Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha has fallen vacant by reason of resignation ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      412.69,
      539.9,
      459.76
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the Ceylon Workers Congress (Political Wings), the recognized political partyto which Thangaraj Kisokumar, the former Chairman belonged, was required by me under Section 66B(2) of the aforesaidOrdinance, to decide upon the member of that Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha who belongs to such party who shall be declaredelected as a Chairman within a period of thirty (30) days ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      472.69,
      539.91,
      495.76
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the Secretary of the aforesaid recognized political party has communicated his decision tonominate Kanapathy Kulandevel Ravi to fill such vacancy ;",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      508.69,
      539.92,
      543.76
    ],
    "text": "Now therefore I, Pulasthi Pathirana, returning officer of the Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha, acting in terms of Section66B(2) of the Local Authorities Elections Ordinance (Chapter 262) as amended by Local Authorities Elections (Amendement)Act, No. 16 of 2017 do hereby declare Kanapathy Kulandevel Ravi elected as Chairman of the Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      416.61,
      568.69,
      530.02,
      603.76
    ],
    "text": "PULASTHI PATHIRANA,Returning Officer,Norwood Pradeshiya Sabha.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      616.69,
      148.66,
      654.16
    ],
    "text": "District Election Office,Nuwara Eliya,30th May, 2018,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
